  "real_world_scenario": "A Pangasinan barangay needs a small day-care and evacuation support building. A vernacular-informed answer studies local climate, available materials, raised floors, shaded edges, cross-ventilation, and community use patterns, then translates those lessons into a current safe building instead of copying old forms as costume.",
